		)
		(uuid "a1ad61de-82f0-227a-0526-e54497b2720f")
	)
	(text_box "3.3 V and 1.1 V: one 100 nF for every supply\npin. On the board each sits at its pin,\nexcept where the pin is walled in by signal\nlines (pins 6, 11, 20, 23): those join it\nthrough the supply rings under the chip."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 209.55 35.56 0)
		(size 40.64 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "a74906b6-4b85-e8f4-0bef-beda9084ab70")
	)
	(text_box "DC: the board ID. R21\nis 1 k down here, 10 k\nup on GPiBridge. The\nfirmware reads DC at\nstart-up, before it\ndrives anything: low\nruns the Lite's pin\nlayer."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 344.17 148.59 0)
		(size 22.86 16.51)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b17dc968-315c-ca9c-0a77-b019a6c550da")
	)
	(text_box "Raspberry Pi debug connector (JST-\nSH 3-pin): the Debug Probe's 'D'\ncable. 100 R on the target side,\nat the connector (the spec: at the\nchip). 3.3 V logic."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 148.59 0)
		(size 33.02 11.43)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0)
			(type default)
		)
		(fill
			(type color)
			(color 255 255 194 1)
		)
		(effects
